game genre - roguelike
basic story - 
Retro figures have declared a war to the modern players.. 
In the old maps (such as the crossroad or the roblox HQ), the modern players should fight aganist the retro-styled enemies.
places -
- Round (or also Match)
 - where players actually "play" the game.
 - a round can be joined by maximum 8 people, and it is divided into chapters and waves
- Lobby
 - the place where the player will stay other than the rounds
 - there are some structures where players can enhance their gears and maintain their status
mechanics - 
-8 players can join at once
-There are chapters divided, and by the chapters, the maps and the enemies change.
-Blacksmith is a npc in the lobby and it ables the players to upgrade their equipments, craft new items, and enchant those.
 - enchanting grants buffs or special abilities that depends on the item where the enchantment is
 - enchanting is done by an item called enchanting stone, and the type and the materials to make the stones all differ.
-Every chapter, there are 20 waves, and there are unique mobs spawning at 5th,10th,15th waves and the boss spawning at 20th wave.
-Throughout the waves, players will obtain items from the mobs or from the map in order to enhance their basic weapons or armories.
-There are gears that players can equip before joining a round (They can be obtained from the mobs or a gacha machine located at the lobby)
  -gears will grant either special skills, unlock specific abilities, stat buffs, or increased drop rate of certain items
